     "rating": 9
    },
    "content": "Decided to revisit this after many years and still holds up so well. Great movie for both kids and adults with wonderful teachable moments. Just a groundbreaking animated movie all around. **4.5/5**",
    "created_at": "2019-10-14T19:32:09Z",
    "id": "5da4cd398a88b20013c654b7",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-23T15:58:27Z",
