   {
    "author": "r96sk",
    "author_details": {
     "name": "",
     "username": "r96sk",
     "avatar_path": "/mwR7rFHoDcobAx1i61I3skzMW3U.jpg",
     "rating": 10
    },
    "content": "A stunning feature film entrance from Pixar! <em>'Toy Story'</em> is a true delight, from the first second to the last.\r\n\r\nThe CGI animation is excellent. All the toys look brilliant, as does the world itself - I love the feel of it. The music is very good, Randy Newman does a nice job - \"You've Got a Friend in Me\" is a cracker.\r\n\r\nTom Hanks leads a strong cast. Hanks plays Woody, to fantastic effect. He is the best part of this film. Tim Allen is great, too, as Buzz Lightyear. Don Rickles (Mr. Potato Head), Wallace Shawn (Rex) and John Ratzenberger (Hamm) also bring fun.\r\n\r\nEverything else is",
    "created_at": "2020-06-28T12:08:58Z",
